  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping and identification,  Danish support for green energy transition in Kosovo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at identifying potential development programme(s)/project(s) on energy transition (energy efficiency/renewable energy) to be implemented in a form, conditioned by the Danish non-presence in Kosovo, e.g. delegated partnership with like-minded donors or/and through multilateral/international organization present in Kosovo. The scoping is based  on four analyses; i.e. problem analyses, donor mapping, input from relevant strategies and lessons learnt.</narrative>
  </description>
